Additional notes

This package is built entirely on open-source software and is itself open
source. It is published as an example of how to put existing components
together, nothing more.

It is not a commercial product. No license fee is charged for it, and it
contains no restrictions, limitations, gated features or any other mechanism
constraining what may be done with it. Anyone is free to use, modify and
redistribute it as they see fit.

The only constraints that apply are those of the licenses of the third-party
components this package relies on. Those components are not distributed with
this package - they are installed from the distribution's own repositories -
and each remains under its own license:

  ModemManager                     GPL-2.0-or-later
  NetworkManager                   GPL-2.0-or-later
  libqmi / libmbim                 GPL-2.0-or-later (libraries LGPL-2.1+)
  mobile-broadband-provider-info   public domain
  systemd                          LGPL-2.1-or-later
  raspi-utils (pinctrl)            BSD-3-Clause

Refer to each project for its exact terms; the list above is a convenience
summary, not a legal statement, and may change between distribution releases.

The authors accept no responsibility or liability whatsoever for any use or
